---
description: Package source rules (TypeScript; this repository has no PHP or Symfony code)
globs:
  - "packages/*/src/**/*.ts"
  - "packages/*/package.json"
alwaysApply: false
---

- TypeScript strict mode; ESM; no new runtime dependency in `beacon-core`.
- Node packages support Node >= 20; the browser package targets evergreen browsers.
- A public API change regenerates `packages/*/etc/*.api.md` (`pnpm build`); CI fails when it is stale.
- File names are kebab-case; JSDoc in English.
- New or removed source files update `specs/001-baseline/code-inventory.md`.
